<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Sangstat rated buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Sangstat rated buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Robertson Stephens said analyst Donald Ellis initiated coverage of SangStat Medical Corp with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- Believes company will become profitable in 1998, then generate long-term earnings per share growth of 35-40 percent.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 1-1/8 to 29-1/8.</p>
</text>
